# Build-context exclusions for Dockerfile and Containerfile.scan (W17-27).
#
# The Dockerfile's `source` stage copies the whole checkout. Without this
# file that copy included deploy/scan-rules/vuln-db — the 1.9 GB grype
# database the sync script leaves in the checkout on a dev machine — and the
# build died with "no space left on device" in the podman machine, on a layer
# no image needs. The database is mounted at run time, never built in.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.data
deploy/scan-rules/vuln-db
deploy/scan-rules/vuln-db.stage
deploy/scan-rules/vuln-db.old
# W21-05: the package-name index (~110 MB for npm/PyPI/RubyGems).
deploy/scan-rules/package-index
deploy/scan-rules/package-index.stage
docs/work/product-completion/baseline
docs/work/product-completion/evidence
